SCENE TIMING (15 SECONDS TOTAL)

Each scene 1–2 seconds max. Fast, dynamic, Matrix-like cuts.

(0.0–0.2s) SCENE 0 — Dynamic Anchor Shot

Camera already sliding left-to-right past her desk.
Holographic UI panels hover above her laptop.
Dust motes swirl in the sunlight.
Her hair moves subtly; papers flutter.
Laptop emits soft golden glow.

(0.2–1.4s) SCENE 1 — World Seed Ignites

Close-up of her hands.
She drags a glowing contour line across the air;
a tiny fragmented island builds itself from floating triangles.
Particles trail behind the forming landmass.

FX: refractive shimmer, soft chimes.

(1.4–2.6s) SCENE 2 — Ocean Projection Spreads

Camera swings to 3/4 angle.
A translucent ocean hologram expands over the desk surface,
rippling like real water but suspended above the table.
Blue mist rises.

FX: wave simulation, light refraction.

(2.6–3.8s) SCENE 3 — Skyline Shifts with Her Edits

Quick external zoom through the window.
New York skyline briefly morphs into a fantasy world:
floating towers, sky bridges, glowing ship-lanes.
Then snaps gently back.

FX: building morph transitions, sunlight pulses.

(3.8–5.0s) SCENE 4 — World Fragment Rotation

Back inside.
She rotates a mid-air continent; mountains rise as it spins.
Holographic tectonic plates slide under the landmass.

FX: rotating gridlines, tiny gold sparks on edges.

(5.0–6.2s) SCENE 5 — Atmospheric Layering

A soft fog layer forms above the 3D model,
then glowing weather currents swirl on top.

FX: thin white vortices, heat shimmer.

(6.2–7.4s) SCENE 6 — Top-Down Map Moment

Camera pulls overhead.
The entire desk becomes a living atlas—
roads auto-draw, rivers light up, coastlines pulse.

FX: rapid “auto-cartography” lines, neon flickers.

(7.4–9.0s) SCENE 7 — She Adds Life

Tiny glowing cities blink into existence on the hologram,
like bioluminescent fireflies.
Her expression: soft wonder.

FX: bokeh particles, micro lens flares.

(9.0–11.0s) SCENE 8 — Full World Suspended

The completed micro-planet rises above her hands,
a slowly rotating holographic globe
with oceans, cities, mountains, clouds.

Camera orbits fast, then slow.

FX: sub-bass boom + bright golden flare.

(11.0–12.8s) SCENE 9 — Sky Outside Responds

The city outside reflects her world:
a giant shadow of her holographic planet casts across the skyscrapers;
floating clouds match the hologram's atmosphere.

FX: synchronized light, ambient wind.

(12.8–14.6s) SCENE 10 — The Masterstroke

She pinches her fingers, and the world compresses into a glowing data crystal,
hovering above her palm.
Hair & papers surge from the energy release.

Camera pushes in fast.

(14.6–15.0s) SCENE 11 — END CARD

Data crystal explodes into a soft golden nebula.
Text materializes:

THE WORLD BUILDER
